meta {
  name: 06 Revoke activation key
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/centers/me/students/{{studentId}}/activation-key
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.revoked: eq true
}

docs {
  Cancels an outstanding key without removing the student — for a key handed to
  the wrong person, or a student who is not going to start after all.

  Afterwards, `Student Activation / 01` with that key must fail.

  The seat stays occupied. Revoking a key is not the same as removing the
  student; use `07 Remove student` to free the seat. Check
  `Center Subscription / 02 Get usage` before and after to confirm `seatsUsed`
  is unchanged.
}
